<title>THAILAND: Thai 1996 trade deficit widens to 417.6 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai 1996 trade deficit widens to 417.6 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand said on Thursday that the 1996 trade deficit widened to 417.6 billion baht versus a deficit of 373.8 billion baht in 1995.</p>
<p>Exports in 1996 totalled 1.379 trillion baht against 1.382 trillion baht in 1995.</p>
<p>Imports amounted to 1.797 trillion baht compared with 1.756 trillion baht in 1995.</p>
<p>NOTE:Import export figures are rounded up.</p>
</text>
